<title>ISRAEL: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>ISRAEL GOVERNMENT LIST (970707)</p>
<p> President..........Ezer WEIZMAN</p>
<p>(Sworn in 13 May 93 for a 5-year term)</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>LIKUD-LED COALITION GOVERNMENT (Sworn in 18 Jun 96)</p>
<p>(For party affiliations see end of list)</p>
<p> Prime Minister........Benjamin NETANYAHU (LIK)</p>
<p>(Sworn in 18 Jun 96)</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Housing &amp; Construction, Religious Affairs</p>
<p>	 and Science)</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture &amp; Environment...Rafael EITAN (TZO)</p>
<p> Commerce &amp;  Industry.....Natan SHARANSKY (ISR)</p>
<p> Communications..............Limor LIVNAT (LIK)</p>
<p> Defence................Yitzhak MORDECHAI (LIK)</p>
<p> Education &amp; Culture........Zvulun HAMMER (NRP)</p>
<p> Finance.....Yaacov NEEMAN (NON)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs...............David LEVY (GES)</p>
<p> Health.....Yehoshua MATZA (LIK)</p>
<p> Housing &amp; Construction..... See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Immigration...............Yuli EDELSTEIN (ISR)</p>
<p> Interior.......Eli SUISSA (SHA)</p>
<p> Internal Security.......Avigdor KAHALANI (THI)</p>
<p> Justice.....Tsahi HANEGBI (LIK)</p>
<p> Labour &amp; Welfare...............Eli ISHAI (SHA)</p>
<p> National Infrastructure.....Ariel SHARON (LIK)</p>
<p> Religious Affairs...........See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Science......See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Tourism......Moshe KATZAV (LIK)</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Energy..........Yitzhak LEVY (NRP)</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>LIK -- Likud</p>
<p>NRP -- National Religious Party</p>
<p>THI -- The Third Way</p>
<p>SHA -- Shas</p>
<p>ISR -- Israel ba-Aliya</p>
<p>TZO -- Tzomet</p>
<p>NON -- Non-aligned</p>
<p>GES -- Gesher</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Speaker of the Knesset............Shevah WEISS</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor............Jacob FRENKEL</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
